It is necessary to continue to give full play to the role of an important starting point, such as national constitutional day activities and constitutional oaths, and make more people's popular ways.
Carry out constitutional publicity and education, strive to improve the literacy of the rule of law in the whole country, build a solid ideological foundation and create a good social environment for the implementation of constitutional laws.
Establish a constitutional consciousness, enhance constitutional self-confidence, and become a firm believer, preacher, practitioner and maintainer of the Constitution.
Mr. Lee attended the symposium.
Wang Chen presided over the symposium.
In 2017, the Fortune Global Forum will be held in Guangzhou from December 6th to 8th, and Vice Premier of the State Council Wang Yang will attend the opening ceremony of the forum.
He also delivered a keynote speech.
