We will promote the study and implementation of the spirit of the 19th National Congress of the Communist Party of China and Xi Jinping's socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics in the new era, so as to inspire and inspire the vast number of cadres and the masses to use the great spirit.
Promote the great practice, do not forget the original intention, remember the mission, always struggle, and make unremitting efforts to achieve the tasks put forward by the 19th National Congress of the Communist Party of China.
