In this year's drama category, "seeing the emperor" and "review" competition is fierce, and the two newcomers finally defeated a group of old actors: the award for best actor Rami Marek was won by the first-nominated "Hacker Army" actor Rami Marek, and the best actress award was won by Tatiana Masllani of "Black Orphans".
The winners of this year’s Emmy Awards were Game of Thrones and American Crime Story.
U.S. Crime Story has won important awards in the miniseries/television film categories, while Game of Thrones has won 12 awards (including technical categories), which include three blockbuster awards for best drama, best director, and best screenwriter.
So far, "Game of Thrones" has won 38 Emmy Awards, making it the most Emmy Award-winning TV series in history.
