The reporter of the Beijing Business Daily found that the Guangdong Shangpin Home Furnishing Co., Ltd., which is aimed at the small and medium-sized boards of the Shenzhen Stock Exchange (hereinafter referred to as Shangpin's home matching), is listed among them.
According to the newly announced prospectus, the company was established in 2004, registered in Guangzhou City, mainly engaged in the personalized customized production, sales and the sale of supporting home products, and to the home industry enterprises to provide design software and informatization overall solutions design, research and development and technical services.
On December 26, the reporter learned from the Municipal Environmental Protection Bureau that in 2012, Lu'an City successfully declared a total of 98 national and provincial environmental protection projects, striving for a total of 14.526 million yuan of special funds for environmental protection.
Among them, there are 55 national-level environmental protection projects, striving for national environmental protection special funds of 13.246 million yuan; 43 provincial-level environmental protection projects, and 12.8 million yuan in provincial-level environmental protection special funds.
It is understood that the construction of the project involves the comprehensive management of the regional water environment (including the ecological environment protection of Huabu Lake), the environmental protection of drinking water sources, the comprehensive remediation of the rural environment, the prevention and control of large-scale livestock and animal husbandry pollution, the pollution control of industrial enterprises, and the demonstration of the construction of an ecological city.
After the implementation of the project, it will play a positive role in promoting the regional scientific development of Lu'an City, realizing the rest and recuperation of lakes, accelerating the improvement of water environment quality in the river basin, ensuring the safety of drinking water, and promoting energy conservation and emission reduction.
Today, four groups, such as Tonglu County in Zhejiang Province, have won the 8th China Environment Award.
Held in 2000, the China Environmental Award is the highest award in the field of environmental protection in China, with a selection committee composed of a number of central departments.
Li Wei, head of the selection committee and secretary-general of the China Environmental Protection Foundation, said that China is facing ecological problems left over from the heavy GDP and light environmental protection development model in the past few decades.
This year's selection of the China Environment Award aims to recognize units and individuals who have contributed to the improvement of people's livelihood in order to show respect for public opinion.
In the opinion of the selection committee, Tonglu County in Zhejiang Province, based on the ecological prefecture, received this honor.
