He said that the story of "bean evangelization" took place in the year of the Western Han Dynasty, Huainan King Liu An Ningdan Xiu Xian in the context, the film's protagonist "bean blessing" is an adult-shaped bean that accidentally ignited the shape of an adult in Liu'an.
