Walking into the Guang'an Convention and Exhibition Center, there are no slogans, there are no tea cups, and there is not even a bottle of ordinary mineral water.
It is replaced by a simple banner, a meeting location, a simple and environmentally friendly paper bag of meeting materials, and an eco-friendly paper cup of tea.
The conference materials were a little thinner than before, and a few sheets of paper summarized the theme and agenda of the meeting.
Back to the simple and realistic meeting environment to the present, we are very understanding and very welcome." Wang Cheng, a representative of the Guang'an Municipal People's Congress, said that they are willing to see and participate in efficient and pragmatic and non-formalistic meetings.
