Strolling through Shaoxing Anchang ancient town, you can see traditional handicraft skills such as hoop barrels, bamboo weaving, playing irons, shoes, picking chrysanthemums, and spinning cotton, which fully demonstrates the intangible cultural heritage of Anchang Ancient Town.
It is reported that during the three-day holiday on New Year's Day this year, more than 65,000 tourists in Anchang Ancient Town.
In Zhejiang, a small town with a unique style like the ancient town of Anchang: Jiaxing Xitang's waving light, flowing with the warmth of Jiangnan Water Township; the white-walled Dewa of the twenty-eighth city in Quzhou, telling the vicissitudes of the thousand-year-old ancient town; the fisherman's paintings in Shitang Town in Taizhou, which are both traditional and modern.
In recent years, with the promotion of global tourism construction in our province, the potential of small towns in Zhejiang has been gradually awakened.
In 2016, the general office of the provincial government officially released the implementation measures for the creation of tourist-style towns in Zhejiang Province, and put forward the approval of about 100 provincial-level tourist-style towns in the province's acceptance by about five years.
Nowadays, these small towns have become an important destination for tourists to Zhejiang to enjoy the mountains and waters of Zhejiang, to read the culture of Zhejiang, and to feel the nostalgia of Zhejiang, which will also provide an important help for our province's efforts to create "poetry Zhejiang" China's most beautiful tourist destinations.
The relevant person in charge of the provincial tourism bureau introduced that under the craze for the creation of tourist-style small towns, now all townships in the province pay more attention to the creation of the personalized tourism industry, and new tourism projects and formats have emerged, which has brought a rich experience for tourists and won a good reputation.
focus on promotion.
Recently, sponsored by the Zhejiang Provincial Tourism Bureau and the Zhejiang Daily Newspaper Industry Group, the "small town×future artist" hosted by the "small town×future artist" and the closing ceremony of the "Poetry and painting in Zhejiang Town" 2017 Zhejiang tourism town promotion season was held in the exhibition hall of Zhejiang Province.
"Cultural towns have the beauty of art and the temperature of life.
The style of the small town lies in the originality, the original taste, the original hometown, a pure original ecology.
China Academy of Fine Arts School of film and television science and television teachers, domestic first-line film and television advertising director Xie Hanfeng, as well as the dean of the School of Art and Communication of the China Metrology University Professor Xu Xiangyi and other experts, told the "small town in the camera", "small village reconstruction" and other cross-border stories of small towns.
There are a lot of tourist towns in Zhejiang that have profound cultural resources, and the small-town representative from Nanxun, Huzhou City, was at the scene for everyone to interpret the national painting.
Jiangnan Shuixiang style has been loved by book painters since ancient times, and today, Nanxun Ancient Town has carried out in-depth cooperation with art institutions such as the Chinese Academy of Arts.
A tourist town must elements, tourism elements, service elements and environmental factors.
Among them, the tourism service facilities and environment are also very important contents.
On a rainy day with a timely umbrella, it can also allow tourists to better experience the style of the small town.
In this era of sharing, Zhejiang News Group's tourism all-media center teamed up with the hottest shared umbrella company to customize a number of "poetry Zhejiang" version of shared umbrellas, hoping to advocate the concept of "sharing? green", to enhance the civilized tourism awareness of tourists and small-town residents, and to create and share a beautiful tourism environment.
This has become one of the highlights of the "Poetry and painting in Zhejiang? Town has a style" in the 2017 Zhejiang tourism town promotion season activities.
Awesome expectations.
Up to now, Zhejiang Province has released the list of the first batch of 21 provincial-level tourist-style small towns and a list of 115 provincial-level tourist-style small towns.
As a key area for the priority development of rural tourism during the "Thirteenth Five-Year Plan" period, the style small town will eventually be built as a tourist scenic spot above 3A level, becoming a new model for diversified tourism products, outstanding tourism benefits, and win-win industrial integration.
The reason why the tourist town is attractive, the key is its original taste.
The beauty of the tourist town is not only derived from the small bridge flowing with smoke and rain, but also from a long-standing cultural tradition; rural rejuvenation stems from cultural self-confidence.
Looking at the whole world, the small town of Lisse in the Netherlands, the small town of Hallstatt in Austria, and the small town of squash in France, with tulips, "salts" and pumpkins as the core attractions, each year to attract a large number of tourists from all over the world, so as to achieve tourism to boost the economy of the town.
The focus of "highlighting characteristics and retaining nostalgia" makes the town have a distinct personality and soul, and it is also necessary to provide cultural infiltration, carry the local context, and highlight the local civilization.
With culture and nostalgia as the link, with the humanities and the scenery as the carrier, it connects the four-way tourists, so that the traditional style and culture can be inherited and innovated in co-construction and sharing.
In essence, the tourist-like town is a composite open-ended tourist attraction, which should be a shared living space for local residents and foreign tourists and even residents.
As the main battleground for the growth of tourism in the future, tourist-style small towns may not only change the ecological appearance of the countryside, the mode of economic and social development and the direction of the flow of industrial factors, but also an important force to eliminate the gap between urban and rural infrastructure and awaken the recovery of rural culture.
In the tide of accelerated revitalization of the countryside, the tourist town in Zhejiang will interpret a richer and more wonderful story.
