Online e-commerce platforms and offline retailers have their own advantages and disadvantages, but consumers appear in a variety of channels, so both sides are experimenting with omni-channel models.
The industry believes that under the background of consumption upgrades, there will be more and more "box horse" stores in 2018.
From the initial fresh constantly to explore more consumer areas, indicating that in the new year, there will be more innovations in the retail market.
"For example, the combination of online and offline business model has attracted the attention of consumers, and fresh supermarkets around the world are applauded."
"But this relationship is no more, no more drowsight is useless, and finally implemented to whether you have brought a good experience to the consumer, I have experienced a good will be willing to pay."
Yuan Bin, co-CEO of Darunfa, believes that in the new retail environment, the habits of consumers have changed, and the demand for purchases has also changed.
The original pure online, the line is divided, the line to defeat the line, the line to counterattack the line, is now holding hands together, because the consumer no longer has the distinction between online and offline.
The scramble of capital to enter the market, so that the new retail gunpowder, which is currently represented by fresh supermarkets.
At present, the competition of new retail in first-tier cities is still far away from the pattern of the Red Sea, and there are still a large number of second-tier cities that have yet to be explored, and there are still great opportunities and space for the market.
The layout of different types of industries for new retail will bring the development of new retail into a state of diversified development.
