This makes the family of Aunt Gao, who live in the dormitory of the Democracy Road Machinery Hall in Nanning City, very happy.
Neighbors also said that it was very rare to see rich trees bloom. The residents of the community thought that this was a very auspicious thing, and when they learned it, they all came to see it with great interest.
The scientific name "Maraba chestnut" is a kind of tropical plant, native to Mexico, warm and moist, must be in the sunshine, water, nutrients and many other conditions are appropriate in the case that flowering may occur.
Even in the field with suitable tropical conditions, the flowering of rich trees is very rare, and there has been a saying that the flowering rate is only one in a thousand.
In the morning, the reporter came to the dormitory of Nanning Democratic Road Machinery Hall, and under the guidance of Aunt Gao, the reporter saw the rich tree.
Wealthy trees are planted in the flower garden of the community, which is about 5 meters high, and the coarsest branches are about 30 centimeters long, and the leaves are verdant and luxuriant.
The flowers open at the top of the higher branches, the blooming flowers are more than 10 centimeters wide, the pale yellow filaments are evenly dispersed, the green buds are curled on the two sides after cracking, the flowers are as thin as silver wire, and the silhouette Venus is dotted.
Aunt Gao told reporters that this rich tree has been planted for 8 years, at that time, it was about 1 meter high, and it is now more than 5 meters long.
This is the bonsai that her son bought from the flower and bird market, and later planted in the flower garden, she did not take care of it very much, that is, it is sometimes the cultivation of the soil.
