"Sichuan-made" new energy vehicles against the upward trend of financial subsidies weakened, charging facility penetration rate is not high, ternary lithium batteries suspended in the use of new energy buses, in the face of the current upward pressure in the domestic new energy vehicle market
From November 3rd to 6th, in the first phase of the 16th Western China International Exposition (hereinafter referred to as the "Western Expo"), Chengdu, Nanchong, Ya'an and other six cities and states have shown their development achievements in the advanced manufacturing industry, of which new energy vehicles have emerged and new products have attracted widespread attention in the industry.
At present, with the weakening of financial subsidies for new energy vehicles, the low penetration rate of charging facilities, the suspension of the use of ternary lithium batteries in new energy buses, there is temporary upward pressure in the domestic new energy vehicle market.
However, "Sichuan-made" new energy vehicles are bucking the trend and entering the passenger car and commercial vehicle market segments in a big way.
